d Institute in India.</li>\n<li>Knowledge of Rajasthani Culture.</li>\n<li>More Details Read the Notification.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"10\" valign=\"top\" width=\"735\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000\"><b><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\">RPSC Deputy Jailor Jobs 2024 : </span> Category Wise Vacancy Details<br>\n</b></span></h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Non TSP Area : UR : 26 | EWS : 07 | SC : 11 | ST : 09 | OBC : 14 |&nbsp; MBC : 03 |&nbsp; Total : 70 Post</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>TSP Area : UR 01 | ST : 02 | Total : 03 Post<br>\n</strong></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"10\" valign=\"top\" width=\"735\"><br>\n<!-- 300 x 250 mar 23 --><br>\n<br>\n\n     (adsbygoogle = window.adsbygoogle || []).push({});\n<p></p>\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><b>How to Fill RPSC Deputy Jailor Exam Online Form 2024</b></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Rajasthan Public Service Commission RPSC&nbsp;&nbsp;Deputy Jailor Recruitment 2024, Candidate Can Apply Between <b>08/07/2024 to 06/08/2024.</b></li>\n<li>Candidate Read the Notification Before Apply the Vacancies Application Form in Govt. Jobs of RPSC Deputy Jailor Advt. 04/2024-25 for&nbsp; Dy. Jailor 2024 Latest Govt. Recruitment Online Form 2024</li>\n<li>Kindly Check and Collect the All Document – Eligibility, ID Proof, Address Details, Basic Details.</li>\n<li>Kindly Ready Scan Document Related to Recruitment Form – Photo, Sign, ID Proof, Etc.</li>\n<li>Before Apply Online / Submit Application Form Must Check the Preview and All Columns Carefully.</li>\n<li>If Candidate Required to Paying the Application Fee Must Submit. If you have Not the Required Application Fees Your Form is Not Completed.</li>\n<li>Take A Print Out of Final Submitted Form.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"10\" valign=\"top\" width=\"735\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><b>Interested Candidates Can Read the Full Notifica